sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Web as NextWeb
  participant Agent as AgentAPI
  participant Daily as DailyAPI
  participant Bot as PipecatBot

  User->>Web: Click Start call
  Web->>Agent: POST /sessions
  Agent->>Daily: Create room
  Agent->>Daily: Create user token
  Agent->>Daily: Create bot token
  Agent->>Bot: Start bot (room + bot token)
  Agent-->>Web: session_id, url, token
  Web->>Daily: Join room (user token via Pipecat/Daily)
  Bot->>Daily: Join room (bot token)
  Note over User,Bot: Voice media over Daily WebRTC
  User->>Web: Click End call
  Web->>Daily: Leave / disconnect transport
  Web->>Agent: DELETE /sessions/{session_id}
  Agent->>Bot: Cancel pipeline
  Agent->>Daily: Delete room (best effort)
  Agent-->>Web: 204
